# Yomban.ink — .dev.vars.example
#
# PLANNED (no implementation exists yet). This template carries the NON-SECRET development
# values only (Q15). Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in the secret values LOCALLY.
#
# Bindings (D1, R2, KV, queues) are declared in `wrangler.toml`/`.jsonc` — NOT here.
#
# NEVER commit `.dev.vars` or any real secret. Secrets are set via `wrangler secret put`
# (cloud) and in the local `.dev.vars` only. Example: the better-auth signing key.

# --- Non-secret development values -------------------------------------------------
APP_ENV="development"
# Illustrative only — the dev port is a project-config decision, NOT hardcoded (Q14).
# Change it to match your configured dev port.
PUBLIC_BASE_URL="http://localhost:8787"

# --- Secret names (NO values — set these locally / via `wrangler secret put`) -------
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=""
